   2:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \file      cdd_app.c
   3:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \brief     Public interface for the CddSys low-level system utility module.
   4:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *
   5:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \details   Declares the CddSys function API used across the CDD layer for
   6:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *            TriCore-specific primitives:
   7:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Atomic bit-field load-modify-store (LDMST instruction).
   8:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Binary semaphore via compare-and-swap (CMPSWAP.W instruction).
   9:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Single and multi-instruction NOP delays.
  10:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Interrupt-enable intrinsic.
  11:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *
  12:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *
  13:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \note      EmbedSim naming convention:
  14:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Functions      : Pascal_Snake_Case
  15:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Parameters     : PascalCase  (single-letter → Uppercase)
  16:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Output pointers: PascalCasePtr
  17:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Local variables: lowerPascalCase
  18:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Struct members : PascalCase
  19:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Macros         : UPPER_SNAKE_CASE
  20:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *              - Typedefs       : Pascal_Snake_Case_T
