  50:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *
  51:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \details Single global instance shared between the control-loop ISR
  52:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *          (ControlLoop_ISR), the fast shut-off ISR (TIM0_CH4_ISR), and the
  53:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *          application layer. Declared extern in cdd_app.h; defined here so
  54:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *          that exactly one translation unit owns the storage.
  55:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *
  56:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \note    See CddInverterCtrl_T in cdd_app.h for the per-member semantics,
  57:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *          valid ranges, and the functions that read or write each field.
  58:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  *
  59:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  * \see     CddInverterCtrl_T
  60:../complex_device_driver/cdd_app.c ****  */
